SUMMARY:Skyline at Sundown — Mountaintop BBQ + Live Music
LOCATION:Snow Summit — 880 Summit Blvd\, Big Bear Lake\, CA 92315
DESCRIPTION:Ride Chair 1 to a sunset mountain BBQ buffet and live music at 
 Skyline Taphouse. The ticket includes the round-trip Scenic Sky Chair\, bu
 ffet and entertainment.\n\nWHEN\nThu\, Aug 13\, 2026\, 4:30 PM–7:30 PM\n
 \nPRICE / ADMISSION\n• Age 13+: $40–$75\n• Age 12 and under: $40–$
 50\n• Date-specific reservation required\; may sell out\n\nSCHEDULE\n•
  9:00 AM–5:15 PM — ticket pickup window\n• 4:30 PM — Chair 1 begin
 s guest loading\n• 4:45–7:15 PM — live entertainment\n• 5:30 PM 
 — last chair up\n• 5:30–6:30 PM — buffet service\n• 6:30 PM — 
 chair downloading begins\n• 7:30 PM — last chair down\n\nWHAT TO EXPEC
 T\n• Menu examples include roast tri-tip and grilled salmon\; a full bar
  is available\n• Reservations are date-specific\, nonrefundable and nont
 ransferable\n• No local\, passholder or employee discount is advertised\
 n• Snow Summit lot parking is available\n\nUSEFUL NOTES\n• Arrive befo
 re the 5:15 PM ticket-pickup cutoff\; late arrivals are not issued a ticke
 t\n• Pets are not allowed\n• Non-electric wheelchairs and strollers ar
 e allowed on the chairlift\n• Lift operations can pause for nearby light
 ning\; check mountain status in questionable weather\n\nTBD / VERIFY BEFOR
 E GOING\n• Live entertainer is not named for each remaining date on the 
 current public pages\n\nOFFICIAL SOURCES\n• BBMR reservations\, prices a
 nd access rules: https://www.bigbearmountainresort.com/things-to-do/skylin
 e-at-sundown\n• Official remaining-date list: https://www.bigbear.com/ev
 ents/skyline-at-sundown/\n\nCALENDAR STATUS: CONFIRMED\nLast checked: 2026
 -08-09\nDetails can change. Recheck the official source before making a sp
 ecial trip.
